      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/21/ice-detention-illness-deportation-florida</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Flights to third countries where the detainees have no ties are scheduled as early as Wednesday, relatives detail&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/15/immigration-trump-midterms-reader-q-a"&gt;Send us your questions about immigration and the midterms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Relatives of gravely ill detainees at two &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/usimmigration"&gt;immigration&lt;/a&gt; jails say authorities are about to deport their loved ones to unknown countries in Africa despite worsening medical conditions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flights are scheduled as early as Wednesday, according to the families and the immigration advocacy group the Workers Circle, which has been monitoring conditions and speaking with detainees inside two &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ice-us-immigration-and-customs-enforcement"&gt;Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE)&lt;/a&gt; facilities in south Florida.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/21/ice-detention-illness-deportation-florida"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;</description>
